# PR-010: Distinguish a common-ion effect from a background-electrolyte effect
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 AgCl 0.0001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NaNO3 0.001mol
add v2 AgCl 0.0001mol
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 NaCl 0.001mol
add v3 AgCl 0.0001mol
inspect
